WEBVTT

00:07:58.188 --> 00:08:01.029
Kuthamini nafasi ya baraka maishani

00:08:01.053 --> 00:08:03.053
yanaweza leta unyenyekevu flani.

00:08:03.879 --> 00:08:08.196
Kama si kwa ajali ya uzazi,
ama neema ya mungu

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:10.094
ama fimbo la hatima,

00:08:10.118 --> 00:08:11.375
ningekua nani.

00:08:12.379 --> 00:08:14.736
Huu moyo wa unyenyekevu

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:17.355
ndio fadhila ya uraia tunahitaji sasa.

00:08:18.101 --> 00:08:20.522
Ndio mwanzo wa kurudi

00:08:20.546 --> 00:08:24.792
toka maadili makali ya ufanisi
unaotutenganisha.

00:08:25.466 --> 00:08:29.572
Inatuelekeza kupita ubabe wa ustahi

00:08:29.596 --> 00:08:33.714
hadi maisha ya ukarimu zaidi ya umma